e":"p","children":["For further information, please contact:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Naked Wines plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["Rodrigo Maza, CEO"]},{"type":"p","children":["Dominic Neary, CFO"]},{"type":"p","children":["Catherine Miles, Investor Relations"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["IR@nakedwines.com"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Panmure Liberum (Nomad and Broker)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Ed Thomas / John More / Dru Danford"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Tel: 0203 100 2222"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Vigo Consulting (Financial PR)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Damian Reece, Guy Scarborough"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Tel: 0207 390 0230"]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"p","children":["About Naked Wines"]},{"type":"p","children":["Naked Wines is not just an online wine retailer; we help wine drinkers experience better wine, made by independent winemakers, without compromise."]},{"type":"p","children":["Founded in 2008, we set out to change how wine is bought and sold - funding world-class independent winemakers directly so they can focus entirely on their craft, and connecting them with the customers who value it. Most of those customers we call our 'Angels', and we've been delivering outstanding wines to them for over 18 years."]},{"type":"p","children":["Our model is simple but distinctive. Naked Wines funds independent winemakers' production costs upfront, freeing them from the financial burden of traditional production to take creative risks and make exceptional wine. Because we back them directly, our Angels gain access to proprietary, award-winning wines they can't buy anywhere else - at fair prices that reflect the value of cutting out the traditional supply chain. It's a virtuous cycle: the more Angels back winemakers, the more great wine there is to enjoy, and the stronger the community becomes.  The virtuous circle is a win-win for both wine lovers and winemakers, and enables us to deliver superior benefits to our customers."]},{"type":"p","children":["This is what sets Naked apart. We aren't built to compete at the cheapest, most discount-driven end of the market. We win with customers who value craft, provenance and proximity to the people who make their wine - a community they actively choose to belong to, rather than simply transact with."]},{"type":"p","children":["For our Angels in the UK, US and Australia, that means:"]},{"type":"p","children":["·      Better wine, made by independent winemakers"]},{"type":"p","children":["·      Over 2,500 exclusive wines they can't get elsewhere, from c.280 winemakers across 20 countries"]},{"type":"p","children":["·      A direct connection to the makers - the craft, provenance and stories behind every bottle"]},{"type":"p","children":["·      Personalised recommendations that take the guesswork out of buying wine"]},{"type":"p","children":["For more information visit nakedwinesplc.co.uk and nakedwines.co.uk or find us @nakedwines"]},"This information is provided by RNS, the news service of the London Stock Exchange. RNS is approved by the Financial Conduct Authority to act as a Primary Information Provider in the United Kingdom. Terms and conditions relating to the use and distribution of this information may apply. For further information, please contact rns@lseg.com or visit www.rns.com.",{"type":"p","children":["RNS may use your IP address to confirm compliance with the terms and conditions, to analyse how you engage with the information contained in this communication, and to share such analysis on an anonymised basis with others as part of our commercial services. For further information about how RNS and the London Stock Exchange use the personal data you provide us, please see our Privacy Policy.   END  RAGUPUPPBUPQGAW"]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"London Stock Exchange","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"lse"}]},{"title":"Management","args":[{"id":"section","value":"management"}]},{"title":"UK stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"GB"}]}],"copyright":"Copyright 2019 Regulatory News Service, all rights reserved","id":"tag:reuters.com,2026-09-03:newsml_RSC3578Ta:0","title":"REG - Naked Wines PLC - Result of AGM","published":1788452400,"urgency":2,"permission":"preview","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"LSE:WINE","logoid":"naked-wines-plc","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"naked-wines-plc"}}],"storyPath":"/news/reuters.com,2026-09-03:newsml_RSC3578Ta:0-reg-naked-wines-plc-result-of-agm/","read_time":177,"provider":{"id":"lse","name":"London Stock Exchange","logo_id":"rdp-lse"},"distributor":{"id":"refinitiv","name":"Refinitiv","logo_id":"refinitiv"}}